{"login": "HenriqueRBomfim", "location": "BR", "commits": [{"sha": "a28938b912b21a57fc6d753d144cadf67ba231e9", "message": "Arrumei o espa\u00e7amento de linhas entre os prints", "created_at": "2022-05-14T02:58:31Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c707eb37a53b6347482ebd4dc30fefe3d04c3ae7", "message": "O c\u00f3digo parou de descontar tentativas no caso de repeti\u00e7\u00e3o de palpites", "created_at": "2022-05-14T02:41:03Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ebcb403f98592d337b96b87c61dcc2a6be91cbdf", "message": "Melhorei muito a fun\u00e7\u00e3o de colcoar pontos, agora usei ela para organizar a \u00e1rea e a popula\u00e7\u00e3o. Fiz o programa aceitar respostas como 'sim', 'nao' e 'n\u00e3o'. Coloquei o espa\u00e7amento ideal entre as cores da bandeira e as letras da capital. Fiz o programa printar 'habitantes' quando se pedir a dica habitantes.", "created_at": "2022-05-14T02:30:02Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "96f0fd1a8e3b5333f9520535e3abf05c09588c09", "message": "Tirei dois coment\u00e1rios desnecess\u00e1rios", "created_at": "2022-05-14T01:56:51Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fb9914ac4bcd494791c86d6d4e2626a5e4504534", "message": "*Vers\u00e3o final do programa*, os pontos est\u00e3o sendo colocados corretamente nas dist\u00e2ncias, tudo est\u00e1 funcionando coforme o esperado, colocamos cores adequadas para todas as dist\u00e2ncias e vari\u00e1veis relevantes, tirei bibliotecas e partes in\u00fateis do programa, arrumei a fun\u00e7\u00e3o de colocar ponto no arquivo fun\u00e7\u00f5es_henrique (estava com loop infinito). Gostamos bastante de fazer esse c\u00f3digo, obrigado pela sugest\u00e3o prof Humberto S2", "created_at": "2022-05-14T01:55:44Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3f6a0dd5cb21e5260df1f7f46604360e871e90c4", "message": "fiz uma fun\u00e7\u00e3o para colocar ponto nas dist\u00e2ncias, estou colocando ponto nas dist\u00e2ncias, separei as cores da bandeira e letras da capital por v\u00edrgulas.", "created_at": "2022-05-14T01:06:29Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b7294753d1729b489addbece79aee6da0f905d7f", "message": "Coloquei cor no n\u00famero de tentativas de quando a pessoa acerta o pa\u00eds", "created_at": "2022-05-13T20:02:45Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "722aa4d11d718cbbcfdb998592f9dc53282d6c07", "message": "Arrumei a mensagem de acerto", "created_at": "2022-05-13T19:54:51Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c0ec41c9340d5feae7edc2274338d795497a8b3c", "message": "Organizei as fun\u00e7\u00f5es", "created_at": "2022-05-12T20:51:41Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dbf47f1741c9d244cb7bfa3d532d566f9ad501b0", "message": "Arrumei a finaliza\u00e7\u00e3o do jogo e limpei o c\u00f3digo", "created_at": "2022-05-12T19:26:27Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "715e0d76c86b32f209cd8c87105cc0fffd946dfa", "message": "A lista estava apagando paises, agora n\u00e3o apaga mais, quando o jogador desiste, a resposta n\u00e3o aparece mais duas vezes", "created_at": "2022-05-12T15:12:24Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1d02496d1d47c068d3e8c9a830015328b47927c5", "message": "Coloquei as cores para cada dist\u00e2ncia e n\u00famero de tentativas.", "created_at": "2022-05-12T14:58:52Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "02b82095c415c91fde30fe4582a3e24270928f54", "message": "Coloquei cor nas tentativas", "created_at": "2022-05-12T14:11:34Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "38c9531a726d89c126f4a7f4584544eb84cbf75d", "message": "estamos terminando quase tudo juntos no momento, vamos arrumar o bug de n\u00e3o estar colocando em ordem", "created_at": "2022-05-11T18:05:40Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "895cab55c45607936b9f51151d98f29d1d164751", "message": "arrumei a vari\u00e1vel Acertou, estava escrita incorretamente", "created_at": "2022-05-11T17:12:49Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aa051c96a67152b2445a05505ae0f14ff842184d", "message": "Organizei o c\u00f3digo, e os prints", "created_at": "2022-05-11T17:06:53Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0728a280394e9add62661cfe646956ed6e832121", "message": "Comecei a implementar a exibi\u00e7\u00e3o da dist\u00e2ncia entre os pa\u00edses e terminei a parte de fazer com que o programa rode novamente enquanto o usu\u00e1rio quiser", "created_at": "2022-05-11T02:58:23Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "620ab17b2dea0f09c5ddb8502fc7d777906693c3", "message": "FIz o jogo poder ser jogado quantas vezes o usu\u00e1rio quiser, organizei algumas vari\u00e1veis, fiz um def pro jogo principal, limpei partes bagun\u00e7adas do c\u00f3digo", "created_at": "2022-05-11T02:24:26Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3bd8631f03ae4257f2b8b300673afd1703a1792e", "message": "criei vari\u00e1veis para contar quantas vezes a pessoa pediu cada dica, assim evito que ela perca tentativas, tamb\u00e9m adicionei ifs para cada opcao que a pessoa escolher, j\u00e1 descontando as tentativas de acordo com a dica escolhida", "created_at": "2022-05-10T21:55:06Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "698c017df466f339d99c5b5382932a9b08fca2d6", "message": "adicionei o mercado de dicas, o que ocorre se o usu\u00e1rio digitar desisto e a gera\u00e7\u00e3o aleat\u00f3ria de um pa\u00eds", "created_at": "2022-05-10T21:35:33Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0d0ada459aba8e598b2cda6e60a061ba7c046381", "message": "Comecei o loop", "created_at": "2022-05-10T21:14:15Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25ca077c296a04d44e54c04d0a3a9a46a1d9ecec", "message": "Comentei as partes do programa fiz o print do come\u00e7o do jogo", "created_at": "2022-05-10T20:57:28Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c8bfbdac262e2f86bd5b5b22667ee10e4effea94", "message": "criei o main, importei as biblioetcas e normalizei a base de dados", "created_at": "2022-05-10T18:52:55Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "554fb3655fb58fcafcab7ebee340d090f44cd6d3", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/HenriqueRBomfim/EP-2-Edu-Rique", "created_at": "2022-05-10T16:13:30Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adivinhar-Pais", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "eda3f3f9d259eb60a3d2f6cef9c483374650bb6c", "message": "Coloquei a base de pa\u00edses no reposit\u00f3rio", "created_at": "2022-05-10T16:13:23Z", "repo": "Jogo-de-Adi